---
---
<section class="py-section-padding relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-container-max-width mx-auto px-gutter">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
            <div>
                <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white mb-6">Paletas Web Integradas</h2>
                <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
                    Modernize a interface das suas rotinas. Construa painéis HTML avançados que se comunicam perfeitamente com o AutoCAD, substituindo caixas de diálogo LISP legadas por interfaces web responsivas.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-4">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container mt-1">check_circle</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-white font-label-md text-label-md block mb-1">Sincronização em Tempo Real</strong>
                            <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-code-sm block">Atualizações de UI refletem imediatamente nos clientes sem reinicialização.</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container mt-1">check_circle</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-white font-label-md text-label-md block mb-1">Busca Inteligente</strong>
                            <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-code-sm block">Filtre centenas de comandos e blocos instantaneamente via interface web.</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary-container/20 to-transparent blur-2xl rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="bg-[#0D0D0D] border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-2 shadow-2xl relative z-10">
                    <div class="bg-[#141414] rounded border border-[#262626] h-[400px] flex flex-col">
                        <div class="border-b border-[#262626] p-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#343535]"></div>
                            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#343535]"></div>
                            <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#343535]"></div>
                            <div class="ml-4 font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface-variant">LispCentral Web Palette API</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-6 flex-1 bg-grid-pattern relative">
                            <div class="space-y-4">
                                <div class="h-10 bg-[#0D0D0D] border border-[#262626] rounded flex items-center px-4 w-full">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant mr-2 text-[18px]">search</span>
                                    <div class="h-2 w-32 bg-[#262626] rounded"></div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                    <div class="h-24 bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#262626] rounded p-4 border-l-2 border-l-primary-container">
                                        <div class="h-3 w-20 bg-[#343535] rounded mb-2"></div>
                                        <div class="h-2 w-full bg-[#262626] rounded mb-1"></div>
                                        <div class="h-2 w-4/5 bg-[#262626] rounded"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="h-24 bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#262626] rounded p-4">
                                        <div class="h-3 w-16 bg-[#343535] rounded mb-2"></div>
                                        <div class="h-2 w-full bg-[#262626] rounded mb-1"></div>
                                        <div class="h-2 w-3/5 bg-[#262626] rounded"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
